@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #7C8FA6
  ArrowColor #4A6785
  FontSize 12
}

state "借出\nLoanStatus.LOANED" as Loaned
state "续借校验中\n瞬时状态" as Validating
state "已续借\nLoanStatus.RENEWED" as Renewed
state "逾期\nLoanStatus.OVERDUE" as Overdue
state "已归还\nLoanStatus.RETURNED" as Returned
state "已丢失\nLoanStatus.LOST" as Lost

[*] --> Loaned : 借阅成功 / 生成记录
Loaned : entry / 到期前 3 天提醒
Loaned --> Validating : 续借请求
Validating --> Renewed : [校验通过] / dueDate += 30；renewCount++
Validating --> Loaned : [校验拒绝] / 返回原因码
Renewed --> Validating : [renewCount < 上限] / 再次续借
Loaned --> Overdue : 到期未还
Renewed --> Overdue : 到期未还
Loaned --> Returned : 归还登记
Renewed --> Returned : 归还登记
Overdue --> Returned : 归还并结清罚款
Loaned --> Lost : 申报丢失 / 盘点缺失
Renewed --> Lost : 申报丢失 / 盘点缺失
Overdue --> Lost : 申报丢失 / 盘点缺失
Returned --> [*]
Lost --> [*]

note right of Validating
  瞬时状态，不落库：
  仅用于把“四项校验”的判定过程
  显式化，使顺序图的 alt 分支
  在状态图上有语义落点。
end note

note bottom of Overdue
  逾期是独立状态而非“借出”的属性：
  它改变可用动作集合（不可续借、
  产生罚款、限制新借）。
end note
@enduml
